<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: DCC says prospects for growth are good.</title>
<headline>DCC says prospects for growth are good.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish industrial holding group DCC Plc said on Thursday that its growth prospects were good and it looked to the future with confidence.</p>
<p>&quot;The first two months of the new financial year have shown strong operating profit growth over last year. The prospects for continued growth across the group are good and we look to the future with confidence,&quot; chief executive and deputy chairman Jim Flavin told the annual meeting.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
